sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Mobile Renderer
    participant API as SDUI Service
    participant Source as Static JSON

    Client->>API: GET /mobile/v1/screens/pix_home
    Note over Client,API: App context + contract version + component versions
    API->>API: Normalize typed request context
    API->>Source: Read screens.json
    Source-->>API: Published screen document
    API->>API: Validate Pydantic contract
    API->>API: Compare contract and component compatibility

    alt compatible
        API-->>Client: 200 Screen + compatibilityVersion + ETag
        Client->>Client: Validate renderer support again
        Client->>Client: Render native components
    else known incompatibility
        API-->>Client: 406 Problem Details
        Client->>Client: Apply safe fallback
    else matching ETag
        API-->>Client: 304 Not Modified
    end
